10433,0.023174436762928963,0.003960202448070049,-0.005820754449814558,-0.013049880042672157,0.00047018236364237964,-0.002618100494146347,0.00722516980022192,-0.007136632688343525,-0.010136575438082218,-0.026954255998134613,-0.02501589246094227,-0.0038935707416385412,-0.023396067321300507,0.0031954972073435783,0.0032287489157170057,0.02249935083091259,0.029030295088887215,0.033138662576675415,-0.022488681599497795,Decomposed Prompting (DecomP),"Large Language Models (LLMs) struggle to directly solve complex reasoning tasks in a single, monolithic step.","Complex tasks that can be naturally broken down into a series of smaller, more manageable subtasks.","Prompts LLMs to explicitly decompose the overall reasoning task into a sequence of subtasks. The LLM then solves each subtask step-by-step, building towards the final solution.","Simplifies complex tasks for LLMs, making them more tractable and improving the accuracy of the final solution by addressing each component individually.","Multi-step problem-solving, complex question answering, task automation involving sequential operations.","Decomposed Prompting, DecomP, Prompt Design, Complex Reasoning, Task Decomposition, Subtasks, Step-by-step Solving, Plan-and-Solve Paradigm, Chain-of-Thought, Multi-step Problem-solving, Question Answering, Task Automation"
