9821313619614,0.008615088649094105,0.030778152868151665,-0.012907898053526878,0.013794049620628357,0.008756058290600777,0.004635614342987537,0.000364330830052495,0.009897952899336815,-0.005888413637876511,-0.013665502890944481,-0.005368505138903856,-0.020992083474993706,0.016980072483420372,-0.038360174745321274,-0.007012940477579832,0.007320626638829708,0.02186121791601181,0.02231086976826191,0.03710480034351349,-0.02635590359568596,Knowledge Augmentation,"LLMs have limited, potentially outdated, or domain-specific internal knowledge, leading to hallucinations or inability to answer fact-intensive questions.","LLMs are pre-trained on vast but static corpora. Many tasks require access to dynamic, external, or specialized knowledge sources (e.g., databases, knowledge graphs, real-time APIs).","Integrate LLMs with explicit external knowledge sources beyond simple text retrieval. This can involve structured databases, knowledge graphs, specialized APIs, or real-time data feeds, allowing the LLM to query and incorporate this information into its responses.","Enhances LLMs' factual accuracy, provides access to up-to-date and domain-specific information, mitigates hallucinations, and expands the range of questions LLMs can answer reliably.","Fact-checking, domain-specific question answering, accessing real-time information, grounding LLM responses in verified data.","Knowledge Augmentation, Knowledge & Reasoning, LLM Limitations, Hallucinations, Fact-intensive Questions, External Knowledge Sources, Structured Databases, Knowledge Graphs, Specialized APIs, Real-time Data, Factual Accuracy, Up-to-date Information, Domain-specific Information, Retrieval Augmentation, Tool Augmentation, Memory Augmentation for LLMs, Fact-checking, Verified Data"
