2475,0.011164714582264423,0.029805704951286316,-0.007819161750376225,0.0026604400482028723,-0.011769521050155163,-0.005021810531616211,-0.008487548679113388,0.00010803162876982242,-0.0018816295778378844,-0.022398874163627625,-0.020376009866595268,-0.016691291704773903,0.00278449896723032,-0.03536130115389824,0.0010896314634010196,-0.0025131655856966972,0.01895904913544655,0.015207492746412754,0.0338965579867363,-0.02793312259018421,Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG),"LLMs have a knowledge cutoff, can hallucinate, and may not have access to specific, up-to-date, or proprietary information required for a task. Their parametric memory is limited.","An LLM needs to generate responses or plans that require factual accuracy, access to external knowledge bases, or information beyond its training data, especially when dealing with dynamic or domain-specific data.","Integrate a retrieval mechanism that fetches relevant information from an external knowledge source (e.g., databases, documents, web search) based on the input query or current context. This retrieved information is then provided to the LLM as additional context, augmenting its generation process.","Reduces hallucinations, improves factual accuracy, enables access to real-time or domain-specific information, and enhances the overall relevance and quality of the LLM's output. It also serves as a form of long-term memory.","Enhancing the memory capabilities of language agents, providing up-to-date information for planning (e.g., flight details, restaurant menus), and grounding LLM responses in factual data.","Retrieval Augmented Generation, RAG, Knowledge & Reasoning, Knowledge Cutoff, Hallucinate, Specific Information, Up-to-date Information, Proprietary Information, Parametric Memory, Factual Accuracy, External Knowledge Bases, Retrieval Mechanism, External Knowledge Source, Databases, Documents, Web Search, Additional Context, Hallucination Reduction, Real-time Information, Domain-specific Information, Relevance, Quality, Long-term Memory, Memory Management, Tool Use, Language Agents, Flight Details, Restaurant Menus, Factual Data Grounding"
