425,0.007780864834785461,0.024194402620196342,0.0018720924854278564,0.009166061878204346,-0.00019947932742070407,0.013093845918774605,-0.004812555853277445,0.0026544479187577963,-0.0049315462820231915,-0.008420134894549847,-0.0025968251284211874,-0.024696264415979385,0.024931970983743668,-0.020790357142686844,-0.013572310097515583,0.022738218307495117,0.0038656622637063265,0.020726030692458153,0.03656825050711632,-0.021117137745022774,Self-Correction / Feedback Loop,"LLMs, especially when interacting with external tools or performing multi-step reasoning, can make errors (e.g., incorrect tool calls, invalid arguments, logical flaws) that lead to incorrect final answers.","LLM-based agents operate in environments where actions have observable outcomes, and these outcomes can indicate success or failure.","Design the LLM's operational loop to incorporate feedback, either from the environment (e.g., tool execution results, error messages) or through internal self-reflection on its generated thoughts and actions. The LLM then uses this feedback to identify mistakes, revise its plan, or correct its subsequent actions.","Improves the robustness, accuracy, and adaptability of LLM-based systems, allowing them to recover from errors, refine their strategies, and achieve better performance on challenging tasks.","Robust tool-augmented LLMs, complex reasoning agents, interactive systems requiring adaptive behavior.","Self-Correction, Feedback Loop, Agentic AI, LLM Errors, External Tools, Multi-step Reasoning, Incorrect Tool Calls, Invalid Arguments, Logical Flaws, Observable Outcomes, Environment Feedback, Tool Execution Results, Error Messages, Internal Self-reflection, Plan Revision, Action Correction, Robustness, Accuracy, Adaptability, ReAct, Reasoning and Acting, Memory Augmentation for LLMs, Complex Reasoning Agents, Interactive Systems, Adaptive Behavior"
