-0.012453293427824974,0.004685171414166689,0.02987932227551937,-0.004258917178958654,0.009690606966614723,0.007842552848160267,-0.0017598395934328437,0.0038619027473032475,0.006426044274121523,0.0050080218352377415,-0.005963597446680069,-0.011247619986534119,-0.01400325633585453,0.010957296006381512,-0.03432752192020416,0.003881243523210287,0.008630117401480675,0.023117950186133385,0.0194379985332489,0.039948079735040665,-0.026021435856819153,Tool Augmentation,"Large Language Models (LLMs) suffer from challenges such as hallucination, weak numerical reasoning, and lack of access to up-to-date or specific external knowledge.","LLMs possess vast internal knowledge from pretraining but have inherent limitations in factual accuracy, numerical computation, and real-time information access.","Enhance LLMs' capabilities by integrating them with external specialized tools such as retrieval systems, math tools (e.g., WolframAlpha), code interpreters (e.g., Python, SQL), and structured databases.","Improves LLMs' question-answering abilities, mitigates hallucinations by providing verified information, and enhances numerical and logical reasoning by offloading tasks to specialized systems.","Enhancing factual accuracy, improving numerical reasoning, accessing real-time data, solving domain-specific problems.","Tool Augmentation, Tools Integration, LLM Challenges, Hallucination, Weak Numerical Reasoning, Up-to-date Knowledge, External Knowledge, Retrieval Systems, Math Tools, WolframAlpha, Code Interpreters, Python, SQL, Structured Databases, Question-answering, Verified Information, Numerical Reasoning, Logical Reasoning, Retrieval Augmentation, Tool Orchestration, Chaining, ReAct, Reasoning and Acting, Knowledge Augmentation, Factual Accuracy, Real-time Data, Domain-specific Problems"
