33207006752491,0.030573155730962753,-0.005714853759855032,0.008858454413712025,0.0019987679552286863,0.0051850504241883755,0.0032658809795975685,-0.006928245071321726,-0.010433060117065907,-0.008663740009069443,-0.008728906512260437,-0.030160006135702133,-0.008534397929906845,-0.033328577876091,-0.007989156059920788,-0.0025600865483283997,0.019870081916451454,0.030563894659280777,0.02274060621857643,-0.03197293356060982,xPlain (Interactive Human-in-the-Loop Explanation Framework),"Human experts struggle to interactively inspect, understand, debug, and compare black-box model behaviors for individual predictions.","Structured data, black-box classification models, need for interactive exploration and comparison of local explanations.","Integrates LACE for generating class-dependent and model-agnostic explanations. Provides an interactive UI for instance-level explanation, comparison across target classes and classifiers, 'what-if' analysis by tweaking attributes, and user-defined rules. Summarizes multiple local explanations into 'explanation metadata' (attribute, item, local rule views) for global insights.","Facilitates interactive exploration, debugging, and comparison of black-box model predictions, enhancing trust and providing actionable insights for model improvement.","Model validation, debugging, comparison of classifiers, understanding specific predictions, testing hypotheses, satisfying interactivity desiderata of XAI.","xPlain, Interactive Human-in-the-Loop Explanation Framework, Tools Integration, Human Experts, Black-box Model Behaviors, Individual Predictions, LACE, Class-dependent Explanations, Model-agnostic Explanations, Interactive UI, Instance-level Explanation, Comparison, What-if Analysis, User-defined Rules, Explanation Metadata, Global Insights, Model Validation, Debugging, Classifier Comparison, Specific Predictions, Testing Hypotheses, XAI, LIME, SHAP"
